  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_2",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Prerequisites",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Before installing CE Express, ensure the following are installed and configured:"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_3",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "1. ArcGIS Server",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "- ArcGIS Server 10.9.1 or later\n- Configured and licensed\n- Site created and accessible"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_4",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "2. PostgreSQL",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "- PostgreSQL 13+ with **PostGIS** extension installed\n- Database user with CREATE privileges\n- Remote connections enabled (pg_hba.conf)"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_5",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "3. PHP Server",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "- PHP 7.4 or later\n- Extensions: `pdo_pgsql`, `curl`, `json`, `mbstring`"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_6",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 1: Accept Terms and Conditions",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Run the CE Express installer as **Administrator**. Accept the software license agreement."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_7",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 2: Prepare Installation Folders",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Create the following folder structure on the server:\n```\nC:\\CEExpress\\\n  ├── app\\          (web application files)\n  ├── geodata\\      (terrain, clutter, building data)\n  ├── antennas\\     (antenna pattern files)\n  └── logs\\         (application logs)\n```"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_8",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 3: Prepare Server Configuration",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Edit `ce_express_config.php`:\n```php\n// Database connection\n$db_host = 'localhost';\n$db_port = '5432';\n$db_name = 'ce_express';\n$db_user = 'ce_user';\n$db_pass = 'your_password';\n// ArcGIS Portal\n$portal_url = 'https://your-server/portal';\n$server_url = 'https://your-server/server';\n```"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_9",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 4: Configure Database",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Edit `ce_express_db_config.php` with PostgreSQL connection details.\nRun the CE Express database setup script:\n```sql\n-- Creates CE Express schema\n\\i ce_express_setup.sql\n```"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_10",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 5: Verify Installation and License",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "1. Open CE Express in a browser: `https://your-server/ceexp`\n2. In CE Express Settings License Manager\n3. Enter your license key\n4. Click **Activate** (requires internet for online activation)"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_11",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 6: Enable SSL (Recommended)",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Configure your web server to enforce HTTPS:\n**IIS:** [Enable SSL](#kw:step-6-enable-ssl-recommended:none) certificate Require SSL in site bindings\n**Nginx:**\n```nginx\nserver {\n    listen 443 ssl;\n    ssl_certificate /path/to/cert.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /path/to/key.pem;\n    # Redirect HTTP to HTTPS\n}\n```"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_12",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 7: Configure ArcGIS Portal Publishing (Optional)",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "To allow CE Express to publish layers to ArcGIS Portal:\n1. Create a dedicated ArcGIS Portal service account for CE Express\n2. Edit `ce_express_config.php` set `$portal_user` and `$portal_pass`\n3. Test: CE Express Features Publish verify layer appears in Portal"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_13",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 8: Configure Email Notifications (Optional)",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "For password reset and ticket notifications:\n1. Edit `ce_express_config.php` set `$smtp_host`, `$smtp_port`, `$smtp_user`, `$smtp_pass`\n2. Test: CE Express Settings Send test email"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_14",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 9: Create Database Structure (Inventory3D)",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Run the Inventory3D database initialization:\n```bash\nphp ce_inventory3d_setup.php\n```"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_15",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Step 10: Install Inventory3D Web Application",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "Copy Inventory3D web application package to the web server folder.\nRegister in ArcGIS Portal as a web application."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_16",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "CE Inventory3D Folder Structure",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "```\nCEInventory3D\\\n  ├── webapplication\\    (browser UI)\n  ├── api\\               (REST API endpoints)\n  ├── config\\            (configuration files)\n  └── uploads\\           (attachment storage)\n```"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ce-express-admin-installation_chunk_17",
    "document_id": "ce-express-admin-installation",
    "document_title": "Installation Guide",
    "section_title": "Verifying the Installation",
    "product": "CE Express",
    "version": "Unknown",
    "category": "Administration",
    "source_file": "docs/ce-express/admin-02-installation.md",
    "text": "1. Open `https://your-server/ceexp` in Chrome\n2. Log in with ArcGIS credentials\n3. Verify [Map view](#kw:switching-between-views:ce-express-login) loads\n4. Create a test workspace\n5. Run a test RF prediction"
  },
